KSL Schedule
VRChat 한국수어교실(KSL) Discord schedule bot
https://github.com/LeeSimYul/KSL-schedule


ORIGIN / 기반 코드
------------------

This project began as a fork of:

    HelpingHandsVR/schedule
    https://github.com/HelpingHandsVR/schedule
    Author: Devon

The following are the original author's work and remain so:

  * The event-lane template design and its JSON schemas
      templates/, schema/
  * The manifest build pipeline and the "old" manifest format
      scripts/build_manifests.py, scripts/formats/old.py
  * The original weekly schedule embed layout and its clock/notable-date emoji
      tables, which scripts/embeds.py carries forward
  * The GitHub Actions publish-to-deploy-branch structure
      .github/workflows/build_manifests.yml
  * The schedules for the ASL, BSL, DGS, JSL and LSF lanes and the two
      server-wide lanes, which are preserved unmodified

Added for KSL by contributors to this repository:

  * Discord dynamic timestamps and the timezone helpers
      scripts/timeutil.py, scripts/js/ksl-timeutil.mjs
  * Bilingual (한/영) rendering and the KSL class embed
      scripts/embeds.py
  * Recharging Days, difficulty tiers, VRChat join information
  * The RSVP / reminder / Discord-Scheduled-Events bot
      scripts/bot/
  * Template loading extracted for reuse
      scripts/loader.py
  * Tests
      scripts/tests/


